{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40761","headline":"冬日送凉州刺史 · 李洞","name":"冬日送凉州刺史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宠饯西门外，双旌出汉陵。\n未辞金殿日，已梦雪山灯。\n地远终峰尽，天寒朔气凝。\n新年行已到，旧典听难胜。\n吏扫盘雕影，人遮散马乘。\n移军驼驮角，下塞掾河冰。\n猎近崑仑兽，吟招碛石僧。\n重输右藏实，方见左车能。\n兵聚边风急，城宽夜月澄。\n连营烟火岭，望诏几回登。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}